# Fiat Grande Panda Electric five-door, 2026 onwards.
#
# The electric Grande Panda only; the 1.2 hybrid of the same body is not
# represented. The car is the boxy Stellantis supermini with the squared-off
# wheel arches, the vertical lamp graphics, FIAT pressed into the tailgate and
# PANDA on the black strip below it. UK order books opened on 1 September
# 2025 for both
# powertrains and the cars reached UK dealerships on 27 February 2026.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fiat_Grande_Panda
#
# Dimensions 3.999 x 1.760 x 1.570 m, wheelbase 2.540 m (Wikipedia infobox).
#
# Shape reference: NO true level side elevation exists. Image 1 is a front
# three-quarter about 30-35 degrees off perpendicular, so the flank is
# estimated within the published dimensions and the limitation is recorded.
# Images 2 and 4 are one car; image 3 is a second electric car, identified by
# the pixel E badge on its tailgate.
#
# Colours: grade (d); no UK colour list was obtainable. White, Red, Blue and
# Grey are plain names. Weights 12, 10, 9, 8, total 39, provisional.
#
# Speed 132 km/h, the car's governed top speed. Comfort 75/292, on the line
# 180 + 1.5 x 75: a quiet electric city car with a high seating position.
# Classes 0,1.
# Dates: intro February 2026, the UK delivery date; retires staggered
# 2046-2049.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/fiat-grande-panda-electric.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/fiat-grande-panda-electric.dae. References:
# citycars/references/fiat-grande-panda-electric/ (gitignored; Wikimedia
# Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: no orthographic flank reference exists, so the side
# stations and the overhang split are estimates. FIAT is pressed into the
# tailgate and PANDA is on the black strip below it, as the photograph shows.
# Door embossing and trim-specific wheels are omitted. The electric car only.


obj=citycar
name=FiatGrandePandaElectric(White)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=12
intro_year=2026
intro_month=2
retire_year=2049
retire_month=6
speed=132
class=0,1
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=75
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=292

